{
  "id": "chapter-04",
  "kind": "chapter",
  "sourceKind": "chapter",
  "label": "Chapter 4",
  "title": "The Fiction of Meaning",
  "shortTitle": "The Fiction of Meaning",
  "sourceRange": [
    423,
    490
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "number": 423,
    "title": 424
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum apni life ko ek strange lens se dekhte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 425
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har cheez ka “meaning” hona chahiye."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 426
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har event ka “purpose” hona chahiye."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 427
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har pain ka “reason” hona chahiye."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 428
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin agar direct experience ko dekha jaye…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 429
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh reality khud koi meaning carry nahi karti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 430
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Wo bas happen ho rahi hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 431
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning baad mein add hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 432
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Mind ke through."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 433
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek situation hoti hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 434
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "aur turant mind usko interpret karta hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 435
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "ye kyu hua"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 436
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "iska matlab kya hai"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 437
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "ye mere liye kya signal hai"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 438
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin situation khud kuch nahi kehti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 439
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Wo sirf event hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 440
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Neutral."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 441
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Raw."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 442
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning ek overlay hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 443
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek filter jo experience ke upar lag jata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 444
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur interesting baat ye hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 445
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "hum meaning ko truth samajh lete hain…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 446
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "jabki wo sirf interpretation hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 447
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har cheez ko hum kisi story mein fit karna chahte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 448
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar kuch painful hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 449
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh uska meaning dhundhte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 450
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar kuch good hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 451
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh uska purpose assign karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 452
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But reality doesn’t respond to meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 453
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality simply unfolds."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 454
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning ka sabse strong illusion ye hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 455
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“If I understand why, I will feel better.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 456
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin aksar understanding pain ko dissolve nahi karti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 457
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Wo sirf usko structure deti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 458
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Pain raw hota hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 459
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "meaning usko organized bana deta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 460
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But organized pain still pain hi hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 461
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Mind ko uncertainty intolerable lagti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 462
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye wo har cheez ko explainable banana chahta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 463
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab explanation mil jata hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 464
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ek temporary relief milta hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 465
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“ab samajh aaya”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 466
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin wo understanding reality ko change nahi karti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 467
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Sirf perception ko settle karti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 468
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning ek coping mechanism ban jata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 469
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jo chaos ko story mein convert karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 470
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur story hamesha comfortable hoti hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 471
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "chaos se zyada."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 472
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye hum truth nahi chahte…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 473
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "hum meaning chahte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 474
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur isi desire se ek aur illusion banta hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 475
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Har cheez ka ek hidden purpose hota hai”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 476
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lekin agar deeply dekha jaye…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 477
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ye “hidden purpose” bhi mind ka creation hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 478
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality ko purpose ki zarurat nahi hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 479
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Sirf mind ko hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 480
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab ye samajh aata hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 481
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ek uncomfortable simplicity bachi rehti hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 482
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "cheezon ka hona…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 483
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "bina explanation ke bhi ho raha hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 484
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Meaning wahan se collapse hota hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 485
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "jahan cheezon ko explain karne ki necessity hi dissolve ho jati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 486
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur tab ek shift aata hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 487
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "From “Why is this happening to me?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 488
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To simply…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 489
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“This is happening.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 490
    }
  ],
